# s53a — native Japanese entity world: col num/bool/sym, pres, rel with inv, srel,
# bind entity/mask/num, and a kanji-named fn — every name the kanji itself, no ja lines.
# 両手 rows 2 and 5 carry junk (99, 77) behind absent presence — decoys per ex06.
n 6
col 北 bool 1 1 0 1 0 1
col 金 num 100 200 300 400 500 600
col 両手 num 80 55 99 61 90 77
pres 両手 1 1 0 1 1 0
col 派閥 sym Bandit Player Bandit Nord Nord Nord
col 打撃 num 0 0 0 0 0 0
rel 師匠 2 -1 4 2 -1 1
inv 弟子団 師匠
srel 標的 3 4 | 4 5 | | | |
bind 主人公 entity 2
bind 城内 mask 1 1 0 0 1 1
bind 補給 num 50
fn 脅威 {𝕨⌈𝕩}
